WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.252 --> 00:00:04.379
Lesson number one.

00:00:04.462 --> 00:00:06.715
Less judgment, more awareness.

00:00:06.798 --> 00:00:08.883
Yeah, yeah. So, what's my cut?

00:00:08.967 --> 00:00:11.720
We'll split the haul 80-20.

00:00:11.803 --> 00:00:16.224
Fuck that. Don't you need my Sandevistan?

00:00:16.307 --> 00:00:18.727
But I'm the one pushing
the klepped shards.

00:00:18.810 --> 00:00:21.271
Plus, now I have a trainee to supervise.

00:00:21.396 --> 00:00:22.897
Trainee…?

00:00:39.289 --> 00:00:43.043
I'm actually tight on eddies right now.
Can't we do 60-40?

00:00:43.835 --> 00:00:48.381
70-30. And I'll pay you
the second the job's done.

